    {
      "id": "65b4a604b5164ad248898a296158bbcb8725c9de3cb265621609a604e0e30787",
      "text": "Autocompact",
      "hash": "8a36ad552d898798dd978db0b1b2d4e568ae7f3c3b3295eedb4df69ab8604e0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "10006fa21ddd973d3659e135992031a64a3b7c26e80c8768f3b8251cf8c0674a",
      "text": "Compaction triggered automatically by the harness when the context window approaches full.",
      "hash": "993ea624edea8b3d32c19d56e0694d3002f3285bad7a7605d0bf823626cab404"
    },
    {
      "id": "176a6352924bacf8c1e8d8f521f29b85c9f471c53a12db115e2dc1c8a823c868",
      "text": "Matt Pocock",
      "hash": "2fe2c13509fbd45ec2578a74ef8efda313caad4f19533a102ca7d666ed60881d"
    },
    {
      "id": "0b9d6b870fbf1ce31ba5d4fc743811ec339ab8f1332986feeba4a93e4fd2a625",
      "text": "Copy page",
      "hash": "4104018941ae3ab016c117887a91b4f933f28e36c587b8983373fe9377ce34d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "15eef88fd1aef199f757cdebe7d071bb00606d248fb5a19b2785517f0a436e64",
      "text": "Compaction",
      "hash": "a0ade140bc8e408639e51492b949bc4d31641625ef070015b5d4a5e92ef0edb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "7bdf346d7f47f4cbcf5586d0ade82a2fece6612dac8cf68eb3c15bf0a004e60d",
      "text": "triggered automatically by the",
      "hash": "33c48f9cea2c42e546ff2c8bd680e275eb59b240399bdd190c9bf1d32d574ce4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ef4f93d3de071c2aabc40b69565248181dc27fce94f37e8cab71102c5e969c6f",
      "text": "when the",
      "hash": "7f65bf6e9b669d94ad19c344a432f67a0f4ebd3574c923572e66d58e6e55bbc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "28354f18b8bbb95f04023945b6d75110e736559f5a9df934e4d42330416d3ae7",
      "text": "context window",
      "hash": "6764434518d37f01df452fe2af0af3f314f8c27a72519001ea14189c5ee42476"
    },
    {
      "id": "d772a3199738340a7bf75c37b0260a1106a9cec43a21c40d5f1210c696277f48",
      "text": "approaches full.",
      "hash": "5dcda08a1840c50ee639d1cd6fb2a811493e58c6cd8f18ee2bdc753ec7d0284b"
    },
    {
      "id": "eba1d69576028a825d152c179e582b775fcd62781155eaffd0838391b9789281",
      "text": "The harness watches how full the context window is. When it crosses a threshold — often around 80% — it pauses, asks the",
      "hash": "81d9e6a925d103e13df01f35224c8406b8e641bbf4a7ee60112e70f3a37f94ea"
    },
    {
      "id": "c176dbced11fbda2cce9dd06330d54e2859c154b3b91a61f998fa44333ee578a",
      "text": "to summarise the",
      "hash": "3f6ef69650102fbe03f27d90c857441881874b2033f1ea32e7241a5a9ebfd871"
    },
    {
      "id": "af464e7bc357bd1e39f76e40394432645a6a580a36f30c576324dbaef3340bdc",
      "text": "so far, and seeds a fresh session with the summary. Work then continues as if nothing happened.",
      "hash": "8bad9e0f650e70c249ccb3226f0182839e0d04f6f9bdc79aca351c885fe2a7f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "8939dcd9406720c4002a8f4b741bd75a906acdbd36320e949ab131b723b70a3c",
      "text": "Except something did happen. Compaction is lossy, and autocompact is lossy at a moment you didn't choose. A manual compact happens at a phase boundary, when you can tell the model what to preserve. Autocompact fires mid-task, whenever the threshold is hit — possibly halfway through a refactor, with the summary deciding for itself which of your decisions were worth keeping. The classic symptom: the",
      "hash": "6aacbce3f5979853bfe99fc177d34badce6a7a39abb3c9439cce5af3a97dd8da"
    },
    {
      "id": "d2ecb94fbdb7ef4231f024808e588b94fe9af3a9a7248409aa55fea421f0bfc1",
      "text": "carries on confidently but has quietly forgotten a constraint you established an hour ago, and you only notice when its work starts contradicting it.",
      "hash": "71952b8cdce2623896faf8b3460523a17fe7765b0bae1456ff255401d60d8eb3"
    },
    {
      "id": "294e8b052d839f1eb5c496f20c7fdf7080f423338905758243d30ffafe9e7ed8",
      "text": "The defence is to not let it fire. Watch the context indicator and compact manually at a natural boundary, or write decisions into a plan doc or",
      "hash": "23458bb69a5be04d0e24f22d03f35a09a7de4f7e1d46d5a71731b753bcea2a94"
    },
    {
      "id": "0aabf3fa75bfd0d0ba6ef7812f4e3002da6b905ed20d2f99b8eddf911bd7844a",
      "text": "handoff artifact",
      "hash": "741619a26b388b5e1035994e6e7ce6c59c885ebd231ad21f8d9ff02438a0cbc9"
    },
    {
      "id": "11e2e4a8c5c8a2ff0bf916cb17a6ea7a4f47da308a9fb96240a8bda7eff94971",
      "text": "on disk, where no summary can lose them. Most harnesses also let you customise the buffer — moving the threshold earlier or later, or turning autocompact off entirely — so you can tune how much headroom you keep before it fires.",
      "hash": "2c4d52e9f0ff7294cbe16e166085bf845de2afcdd4f8832a8c27a96207a0c44f"
    },
    {
      "id": "0ede21aa10eb970abf7db67bb56a82b2c8148835ff30d14cdd85035e702489b1",
      "text": "Usage:",
      "hash": "2bad3eeaf33caffe3bc9b482b4934ed19eb4ec3614c12373e1a5c5f8948217da"
    },
    {
      "id": "c112a3cd2e45ca26f4d47db01b050e560acb4db5ffdd8e17f1ecd9769cea0f84",
      "text": "\"It doesn't seem to remember what we decided about the schema earlier.\"",
      "hash": "9dd5911c6605dd84148aecd13cca72afaa0c047f92d0330ed6c33c3971e47145"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb999d3b1980fcd7bb679ceb9069bd48587775e10663f824d5a48ad74cf72198",
      "text": "\"Autocompact fired between",
      "hash": "4be6a110aad1eb1f0d3098a39bec28c912799f17053d29f1b9ad61da77b4b399"
    },
    {
      "id": "29fac7fab4efb9d1f22ea10118b17607931434dcc5367c954622811cdc26b4b9",
      "text": "— the early decisions got summarised and we must have lost something. Reload the plan doc, or compact manually next time so you control what gets kept.\"",
      "hash": "926fde295040ca56a75503729631c7744cf541416de1d71b8d4a1d8dae482ac5"
    },
    {
      "id": "9801b0e2ada19d86f545075c088bbcde1b4f1475c3886aff52e06ee4e4714eac",
      "text": "Previous term",
      "hash": "735604aff9e8f2192b83df4905cfc8e395613e0ce05f8ca85a1d2d1d44fd59f3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c20d3f29c14f6561be933c715c85e9f01337b4702a0c07b36a898986251e961b",
      "text": "Next term",
      "hash": "5219c7ebdc0e098aa6db6f09e405c1b17ab75f1082862906a872e10a16818f9e"
    },
    {
      "id": "2daec47c918a73cf5badaa52112f9d92458d8e9dc42d616bdb8b66e63f8382de",
      "text": "Memory system",
      "hash": "0262e82db5dfb849a70a2a6a94c1afd575205f2d24d5f001afa96f4d8dcb47d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "760ed32fd06c8ea6ce2031c6edf80d3828e7d9eef6f918a0dc18d05da4aa23cf",
      "text": "Want more than vocabulary?",
      "hash": "5d5500a083006a1606e84a03c018904d01364631c6baea4c7a3f8f3f62bf94dc"
    },
    {
